#=GF CC   This family contains a number of ubiquitin-like proteins: SUMO
#=GF CC   (smt3 homologue) (see Swiss:Q02724), Nedd8 (see Swiss:P29595),
#=GF CC   Elongin B (see Swiss:Q15370), Rub1 (see Swiss:Q9SHE7), and
#=GF CC   Parkin (see Swiss:O60260). A number of them are thought to carry
#=GF CC   a distinctive five-residue motif termed the
#=GF CC   proteasome-interacting motif (PIM), which may have a
#=GF CC   biologically significant role in protein delivery to proteasomes
#=GF CC   and recruitment of proteasomes to transcription sites [5].
